<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday in extremely heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 10.76 to 6484.40. For the week, the Dow rose 179.53 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.95 to 394.11.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.20.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1535 to 968.</p>
<p>Volume was 650,065,430 compared with 522,316,300 Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
